border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 100%; background: rgb(216, 40, 33); flex-shrink: 0; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); overflow: hidden;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/></section><section style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(45, 45, 45); word-break: break-all;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, system-ui, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">（二）激励措施</span><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">（1）中关村管委会资金支持</span></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">　　获奖项目优先推荐作为北京市新型基础设施建设示范工程进行推广复制。入驻相关领域中关村前沿创新中心，享受3年租金免除（郊区分园）或者3年租金优惠（城六区及亦庄园）支持，入驻中关村软件园享受1年租金优惠支持，入驻中关村工业互联网产业园享受3年租金优惠支持。此外，各赛道前3名中，符合中关村前沿技术项目申报条件的企业，可直接进入中关村前沿技术项目评审绿色通道，对通过项目评审的企业，根据《中关村国家自主创新示范区提升创新能力 优化创新环境支持资金管理办法》（中科园发〔2019〕21号）第十二条，按照企业设备购置、房租、研发投入等项目实际支出费用不超过30%的比例，给予三年累计最高500万元的资金支持。</span></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">（2）中关村管委会专属服务</span></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">　　市场对接和推广服务：在赛事启动前1个月，我们面向示范区征集了10类14个5G落地场景，赛事启动后，我们将组织5G技术和产品提供方以及运营商与这些场景需求方进行对接。大赛优质解决方案将面向全市和全国进行推广，引导我市5G应用场景建设方采购大赛企业产品及整体解决方案。</span></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">　　投融资服务：组织投融资机构对感兴趣的决赛现场项目进行投融资需求服务。</span></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">　　空间落地支持：邀请各分园单位，根据自身发展和重点任务，同现场项目进行落地和需求服务。</span></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 展览展示：邀请中关村展示中心、中国科技馆、中关村软件园对示范性强、体验性好、适合在馆内展出的决赛项目进行对接。</span></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">（3）京东物流专属服务</span></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 参赛项目条件符合情况下优先纳入京东集团供应商库；<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\">京东集团战略投资部优先对接。</span></span></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section label=\"Powered by 135editor.com\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 0.544px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"><section style=\"margin