 1.5px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(45, 45, 45); word-break: break-all;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, system-ui, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">（一）线上申报</span></p><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, system-ui, Arial, sans-serif;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 参赛企业、团队将参赛材料在规定时间内发送至邮箱wli@zgcgw.beijing.gov.cn。邮件主题及申报材料名字格式：*****赛道_申报单位名字，如5G核心技术创新专题赛_北京***公司或5G融合创新应用专题赛工业互联网赛道_北京***公司。</span></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; display: flex;\"><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px -4px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 100%; background: rgb(216, 40, 33); flex-shrink: 0; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); overflow: hidden;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/></section><section style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(45, 45, 45); word-break: break-all;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-align: justify; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, system-ui, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">（二）线下申报</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-align: justify; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, system-ui, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 各分园可单独组织本分园内企业、团队参与申报，线下材料由各分园推荐统一递交给中关村科技园区管委会相关人员。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; display: flex;\"><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px -4px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 100%; background: rgb(216, 40, 33); flex-shrink: 0; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); overflow: hidden;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/></section><section style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(45, 45, 45); word-break: break-all;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-align: justify; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, system-ui, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; cursor: text; font-size: 14px; outline: none 0px !important;\">（三）申报材料</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; clear: both; min-height: 1em; text-align: justify; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height: 1.75em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, system-ui, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; cursor: text; font-size: 14px; outline: none 0px !important;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 参赛材料必须包括但不限于以下内容：1.按照大赛申报模板，填写《2020年中关村5G创新应用大赛申报材料》并盖章扫描；2.参赛项目内容的PPT介绍。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; display: flex;\"><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px -4px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 100%; background: rgb(216, 40, 33); flex-shrink: 0; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); overflow: hidden;\"><br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/></section><section style=\"margin: 10px 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; word-wrap: break-word !important; line-height: 1.75em; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(45, 45, 45); wor